{
  "info": {
    "name": "DabApp – Mobile: Listing Status Popup (Mark Sold / Close / Reopen)",
    "_postman_id": "dabapp-listings-mark-sold-v1",
    "description": "## Seller \"My Listings\" Status Popup\n\nBacks the mobile popup that shows a seller all of their own active listings and lets them declare, per listing, whether it sold or not:\n- **Sold** → `PATCH /listings/{id}/mark-as-sold` (status `published` → `sold`)\n- **Not sold, remove from listings** → `PATCH /listings/{id}/close` (status `published` → `inactive`)\n- **Undo a close** → `PATCH /listings/{id}/reopen` (status `inactive` → `published`)\n\nAll three only work on the listing's own seller (`seller_id == Auth::id()`) and only from status `published` (mark-as-sold/close) or `inactive` (reopen) — otherwise 422 with `current_status`. Both actions auto-reject any pending SOOM offers on the listing.\n\n### Before you run this\n1. Set `base_url` (defaults to production).\n2. Fill `seller_email` / `seller_password` with a real account that owns at least two **published** listings.\n3. Set `listing_id` (will be marked sold) and `listing_id_2` (will be closed then reopened) to two distinct published listing IDs owned by that seller.\n\nRun Phase 1 → 4 in order. Phase 5 (edge cases) can be run any time after Phase 1.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "https://be.dabapp.co", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "seller_email", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "seller_password", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "seller_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "listing_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "listing_id_2", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Phase 1 — Login (Seller)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1-1 · POST Seller Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.requiresOTP) { console.warn('This account requires OTP verification — complete it via /api/verify-otp, then paste the resulting token into {{seller_token}} manually.'); }",
                  "else if (json.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('seller_token', json.token); console.log('seller_token saved'); }",
                  "pm.test('Login request succeeded', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"{{seller_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{seller_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login",
              "host": [ "{{base_url}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "login" ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Phase 2 — Load the Popup (seller's active listings)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2-1 · GET My Listings (status=published)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('My ads listed', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{seller_token}}" } ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/my-ads?status=published",
              "host": [ "{{base_url}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "my-ads" ],
              "query": [ { "key": "status", "value": "published" } ]
            },
            "description": "This is what feeds the mobile popup: only the current seller's own published (currently displayed) listings. Add category_id / page / per_page as needed."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Phase 3 — Seller declares: SOLD",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "3-1 · PATCH Mark Listing as Sold",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Marked as sold', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Status is sold', function () { pm.expect(json.data.status).to.eql('sold'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [ { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{seller_token}}" } ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/listings/{{listing_id}}/mark-as-sold",
              "host": [ "{{base_url}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "listings", "{{listing_id}}", "mark-as-sold" ]
            },
            "description": "Requires the listing to currently be status=published and owned by the logged-in seller. Auto-rejects pending SOOM offers and removes the listing from public listings (only status=published is publicly shown)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Phase 4 — Seller declares: NOT SOLD, remove from listings",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "4-1 · PATCH Close Listing",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Closed', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Status is inactive', function () { pm.expect(json.data.status).to.eql('inactive'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [ { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{seller_token}}" } ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/listings/{{listing_id_2}}/close",
              "host": [ "{{base_url}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "listings", "{{listing_id_2}}", "close" ]
            },
            "description": "Requires status=published. Sets status=inactive (removed from public listings), auto-rejects pending SOOM offers. Use this for 'no, didn't sell it, hide it' from the popup."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4-2 · PATCH Reopen Listing (undo close)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Reopened', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Status is published again', function () { pm.expect(json.data.status).to.eql('published'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{seller_token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"allow_submission\": true\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/listings/{{listing_id_2}}/reopen",
              "host": [ "{{base_url}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "listings", "{{listing_id_2}}", "reopen" ]
            },
            "description": "Requires status=inactive. Not part of the popup itself — included here to reset listing_id_2 back to published so this collection can be re-run."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Phase 5 — Edge cases (optional, run any time after Phase 1)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "5-1 · PATCH Mark-as-sold on an already-sold listing → 422",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Rejected as already sold/inactive', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(422); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [ { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{seller_token}}" } ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/listings/{{listing_id}}/mark-as-sold",
              "host": [ "{{base_url}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "listings", "{{listing_id}}", "mark-as-sold" ]
            },
            "description": "Run this AFTER Phase 3-1 — listing_id is already 'sold', so this call should now fail with 422 and current_status:'sold'."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5-2 · PATCH Mark-as-sold without auth → 401",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Unauthorized', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(401); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/listings/{{listing_id}}/mark-as-sold",
              "host": [ "{{base_url}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "listings", "{{listing_id}}", "mark-as-sold" ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5-3 · PATCH Close a nonexistent listing → 404",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Not found', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(404); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [ { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{seller_token}}" } ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/listings/999999999/close",
              "host": [ "{{base_url}}" ],
              "path": [ "api", "listings", "999999999", "close" ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
